franchise, copied commercial art

ACCEPTANCE CHECK

1. The image reads immediately as a giant mobile siege snail carrying an
   integrated, ruined watchtower shell.
2. Its face is grotesque, asymmetrical, and darkly comic rather than noble or
   serious; it remains free of gore and body horror.
3. The concept is clearly distinct from Thorncrown: no humanoid body, antler
   crown, leafy cape, or bow.
4. The full sprite uses genuine transparency, fits the 1145 × 1374 canvas, and
   preserves the existing boss camera, approximate scale, and ground baseline.
5. The face, shell, eye stalks, and overall silhouette remain recognizable at
   mobile-match presentation size.
